        "metadata": {
          "category": "podcast",
          "media": {
            "duration": 9225
          },
          "description": "Soccer for Kids is written and presented by Darren Rees – the creator of Football for Kids, the world’s biggest podcast for young fans of the beautiful game. With his trademark energy and love for the sport, Darren brings his passion stateside to celebrate everything that makes American soccer so exciting.\nEach week, Soccer for Kids explores the world of US football – from the biggest stars and rising talents, to legendary teams, unforgettable moments, and the unique leagues that shape the sport across the country. Whether it’s learning about a famous goal, discovering how a team came to be, or hearing fun facts about players, there's always something new to enjoy.\n\nThis podcast is the perfect way to inspire, educate, and motivate young soccer fans. It's made especially for kids who not only love the game, but want to learn more about the people and stories behind it – all in a fun, friendly, and accessible way.\n\nThis podcast contains ads. Yoto does not control these ads and they do not represent us or our opinions. Please listen with care.",
